# Cargo output for bindings/rust
/bindings/rust/target/

# Reader sample books: each text file is 20 MB of a third-party work, so the repository ships the
# shelf metadata in books/catalog.json only. Drop your own *.txt into that folder to read them.
/example/applications/reader/books/*.txt

# zui-pack output: the build tree it configures inside a project, and the
# packages it writes.
**/.zui/
**/dist/

